-- 3. Load — the span takes weight. The full ensemble, still lazy.
-- ~40 cycles (~104 s at 92 BPM).

setbpm 92

d1 kickSoft
d2 brush
d3 ride
d6 bassWalk4
xfadeIn 4 16 compLoad
xfadeIn 5 24 colourLoad

-- the reed joins from the back of the room
xfadeIn 7 32 reedCall

-- keep the 3-against-4 shadow
xfadeIn 9 16 wood3

-- add a little ride bell for lift
-- xfadeIn 3 16 (stack [ride, rideBell])
